WEBVTT

00:01.167 --> 00:04.045
Attention!

00:04.796 --> 00:09.509
I will now explain to you the details
of the Trost Recovery Operation!

00:09.592 --> 00:11.594
Let me start by introducing this fellow!

00:12.429 --> 00:16.307
This is Eren Jaeger,
a member of the Cadets!

00:17.434 --> 00:20.145
He is a successful result

00:20.228 --> 00:22.856
of our top-secret Titan
transformation experiments!

00:23.648 --> 00:28.361
In Titan form, he will lift that
giant rock near the front gate,

00:28.653 --> 00:32.073
carry it to the wrecked gate,
and seal the hole!

00:32.657 --> 00:34.492
As for you,

00:35.160 --> 00:40.206
you will defend him from the other
Titans while he carries the rock!

00:40.540 --> 00:42.792
Should this operation succeed,

00:43.251 --> 00:48.840
we could take back the land
that the Titans have taken away from us!

00:49.507 --> 00:53.887
Indeed, it may seem extraordinarily small

00:53.970 --> 00:57.557
compared to what
humanity has given up so far.

00:57.974 --> 00:59.225
However,

01:00.018 --> 01:03.313
for mankind, that single, small step

01:03.396 --> 01:06.149
could be a big leap forward!

01:20.288 --> 01:22.540
Eren! Don't you recognize me?

01:22.624 --> 01:24.292
I'm Mikasa!

01:24.375 --> 01:26.920
Part of your family!

01:27.003 --> 01:28.755
Dodge, Ackermann!

01:32.342 --> 01:33.718
What the hell?

01:33.802 --> 01:36.721
He's just a regular, dumb Titan!

01:36.805 --> 01:38.431
Change of plans!

01:38.515 --> 01:42.310
We must defend Jaeger from the other
Titans until we can recover him!

01:42.393 --> 01:45.188
He is humanity's hope.

01:45.271 --> 01:47.690
We can't abandon him just like that!

01:50.193 --> 01:51.986
Where am I?

01:55.490 --> 01:57.200
I'm at home.

01:59.160 --> 02:00.161
Jean!

02:00.245 --> 02:02.956
Why isn't he using
his omnidirectional mobility gear?

02:03.498 --> 02:04.666
Oh, no!

02:04.749 --> 02:06.960
Don't tell me it's malfunctioning?

02:07.043 --> 02:08.878
I'll manage somehow!

02:08.962 --> 02:09.838
Mikasa!

02:10.505 --> 02:11.923
What happened to the plan?

02:12.006 --> 02:13.383
It has failed!

02:13.466 --> 02:16.136
We're fighting
because we can't leave Eren behind!

02:17.220 --> 02:19.013
But there are too many Titans here.

02:19.097 --> 02:21.516
At this rate,
we'll eventually be wiped out!

02:24.686 --> 02:26.813
From the back of the head to the nape,

02:26.896 --> 02:30.692
one meter high and ten centimeters across!

02:32.485 --> 02:35.238
Eren, answer me.

02:35.613 --> 02:40.326
Even though just one step
outside the wall lies a hellish world,

02:41.119 --> 02:45.331
didn't you want to go
to the outside world?

02:48.084 --> 02:49.586
Why?

02:51.004 --> 02:52.630
Because

02:52.714 --> 02:54.966
I was born in this world!

03:03.516 --> 03:04.809
Eren!

04:53.084 --> 04:56.254
Damn. I can't believe
I'm dragging everyone down.

05:10.143 --> 05:13.021
Will this really work out somehow?

05:19.277 --> 05:21.029
We can't go on, Captain!

05:22.113 --> 05:24.824
It's just us now!

05:26.576 --> 05:28.202
Let's fall back to the rock for now!

05:34.292 --> 05:35.501
Situation report!

05:35.960 --> 05:38.379
Five Titans are coming from the gate!

05:50.266 --> 05:53.686
There's no way I can just sit around
and wait until the coast is clear!

05:53.770 --> 05:54.854
Jean!

05:55.563 --> 05:57.273
So his gear is busted!

05:57.356 --> 05:58.900
What's going on?

06:01.069 --> 06:02.403
Crap!

06:02.487 --> 06:04.155
What the hell?

06:04.238 --> 06:06.991
Damn it! Of all the times
it can malfunction!

06:09.827 --> 06:10.953
Jean! Stay calm!

06:14.874 --> 06:16.459
Marco!

06:16.542 --> 06:18.086
What are you doing?

06:29.472 --> 06:30.598
Man!

06:30.681 --> 06:32.642
Don't go causing trouble for us!

06:43.528 --> 06:47.031
Damn! Why is the trigger so stiff?

06:50.701 --> 06:51.869
Jean!

06:58.292 --> 07:00.044
What are you doing?

07:00.128 --> 07:02.463
I'm the one who should be asking that!
Now get out of there!

07:34.912 --> 07:36.622
You guys are damn reckless!

07:36.706 --> 07:38.166
No, you are!

07:38.249 --> 07:39.792
That scared the hell out of me!

07:41.919 --> 07:42.879
Look!

08:17.997 --> 08:19.248
Eren.

08:19.540 --> 08:20.833
Mikasa!

08:22.877 --> 08:24.045
Armin!

08:24.128 --> 08:25.963
Eren prevailed!

08:26.047 --> 08:29.091
He's trying to accomplish his mission now!

08:29.175 --> 08:32.762
Now if we just cover for him
until he reaches the gate,

08:32.845 --> 08:34.805
victory will be ours!

08:39.936 --> 08:41.062
Protect him!

08:42.063 --> 08:44.065
Even if it costs us our lives,

08:44.649 --> 08:46.234
we must let Eren reach the gate!

08:47.318 --> 08:50.112
Do not let the Titans get near him!

08:50.738 --> 08:53.950
We need to give Eren backup!
Don't let the Titans get near him!

08:56.869 --> 08:59.705
You two go over to Eren!

09:00.206 --> 09:02.458
That's an order! Is that clear?

09:02.750 --> 09:04.460
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

09:08.130 --> 09:09.507
The Mitabi team!

09:09.590 --> 09:10.883
What are you doing?

09:10.967 --> 09:13.636
The Titans are ignoring us now!

09:13.719 --> 09:16.264
Our only choice is to get close
enough to grab their attention!

09:17.139 --> 09:19.225
Look this way, damn it!

09:19.308 --> 09:23.980
Or else we'll shove our blades up
your smelly asses and kill you!

09:27.275 --> 09:29.527
- Here they come!
- We lured two of them!

09:29.610 --> 09:32.280
Run for the buildings!

09:32.655 --> 09:34.156
That's insane!

09:34.240 --> 09:36.450
Setting foot down there is suicide!

09:36.534 --> 09:39.620
And they have no way to fight
without horses or buildings!

09:39.704 --> 09:44.500
No, it's not. That's the only option now.

09:47.753 --> 09:49.547
Follow Mitabi Team!

09:50.089 --> 09:52.425
Armin, we need to go too.

09:55.177 --> 09:56.470
This way!

09:56.554 --> 09:57.471
Come get me!

10:06.147 --> 10:07.940
My body feels like

10:08.024 --> 10:10.860
it's about to be crushed into a pulp.

10:12.069 --> 10:14.572
Mikasa? Armin?

10:15.823 --> 10:17.408
What are you doing?

10:17.783 --> 10:20.828
You'll end up being Titan food
if you walk around down there!

10:21.829 --> 10:24.248
Come on! Hurry this way, you slowpoke!

10:24.999 --> 10:26.334
Come and get me!

10:28.919 --> 10:30.254
Hey!

10:31.964 --> 10:33.424
Mitabi!

10:39.305 --> 10:41.057
Didn't you want

10:41.140 --> 10:43.851
to go to the outside world?

10:47.229 --> 10:50.858
From the moment we're born, we're all...

10:52.193 --> 10:53.110
free.

10:55.780 --> 11:00.910
Some might try to deny us that,
but it doesn't matter how strong they are!

11:02.787 --> 11:04.330
Fiery waters.

11:04.413 --> 11:06.040
Lands of ice.

11:06.123 --> 11:07.875
Or whatever else!

11:08.542 --> 11:10.002
Whoever gets to see those things

11:10.878 --> 11:14.382
will have the greatest freedom
this world has to offer!

11:16.717 --> 11:17.593
Fight!

11:18.636 --> 11:21.263
If anything is worth
giving your life, it's that!

11:23.516 --> 11:27.436
It doesn't matter
how terrifying the world may be!

11:30.231 --> 11:34.151
It doesn't matter
how cruel the world may be!

11:36.028 --> 11:37.196
Fight!

11:37.863 --> 11:39.198
Fight!

11:40.032 --> 11:41.117
Fight!

11:42.076 --> 11:43.369
Fight!

11:47.123 --> 11:48.999
There's still a Titan ahead!

11:50.626 --> 11:52.002
I'll handle this!

11:54.755 --> 11:56.924
Out of the way!

12:19.905 --> 12:21.866
Go, Eren!

12:24.160 --> 12:25.202
Fight!

12:50.936 --> 12:51.979
Everyone...

12:52.605 --> 12:55.691
Your deaths weren't in vain.

13:01.405 --> 13:04.742
Today, for the first time in history,

13:05.326 --> 13:07.077
humanity has beaten the Titans!

13:08.204 --> 13:09.914
Yellow smoke shell spotted!

13:10.706 --> 13:13.626
It seems the operation was a success!

13:15.085 --> 13:16.879
Send in additional reinforcements!

13:17.838 --> 13:20.674
Rescue the Elite Squad!

13:26.972 --> 13:28.432
The remaining Titans are coming!

13:29.391 --> 13:30.893
Head up the wall!

13:30.976 --> 13:33.187
I'll withdraw after I've recovered Eren!

13:35.189 --> 13:37.191
Armin! How's Eren?

13:37.983 --> 13:40.319
He's unbelievably hot to the touch!

13:40.402 --> 13:43.614
We need to hurry and get him up the wall!

13:47.535 --> 13:50.120
Part of his body is fused to it!

13:50.204 --> 13:53.123
- I can't pull him free!
- Then we'll have to cut him out!

13:53.207 --> 13:55.209
Wait! Please!

14:07.805 --> 14:09.265
Eren! Armin!

14:29.785 --> 14:31.161
Mikasa?

14:32.580 --> 14:34.039
Those are

14:36.500 --> 14:37.877
the wings

14:38.919 --> 14:40.212
of freedom.

14:46.844 --> 14:48.679
Hey. You kids.

14:49.638 --> 14:52.224
What exactly is going on here?

14:58.647 --> 15:01.650
Afterwards, thanks to the help

15:01.734 --> 15:05.029
of the Scout Regiment and the Garrison
Regiment's Corps of Engineers,

15:05.571 --> 15:09.366
Wall Rose once again
held the Titans at bay.

15:12.661 --> 15:18.292
Taking out the rest of the Titans
trapped inside Trost took a full day,

15:18.375 --> 15:22.379
during which the wall-mounted
cannons fired nonstop.

15:25.049 --> 15:27.593
Most of the Titans
that had gathered by the wall

15:27.676 --> 15:29.219
were wiped out by explosive shells.

15:29.845 --> 15:35.225
The few that remained were
mostly mopped up by the Scouts.

15:37.519 --> 15:42.775
During this, a four-meter Titan
and a seven-meter Titan

15:42.858 --> 15:44.735
were successfully captured alive.

15:45.903 --> 15:47.112
However,

15:47.738 --> 15:51.575
there are 207 people
who are dead or missing,

15:51.659 --> 15:54.036
and 897 were injured.

15:54.536 --> 15:58.916
Although this was the first time
humanity had stopped a Titan invasion,

15:58.999 --> 16:04.880
far too many people lost their lives
to celebrate this historic achievement.

16:26.026 --> 16:26.860
Hey.

16:33.575 --> 16:34.618
Are you...

16:35.244 --> 16:36.745
Marco?

16:40.499 --> 16:43.544
Do you know his name, Cadet?

16:43.877 --> 16:45.379
I wondered where he was.

16:45.671 --> 16:49.925
But he's the last person who would ever...

16:50.843 --> 16:51.969
Marco.

16:52.511 --> 16:54.054
What happened?

16:55.764 --> 17:00.144
Did someone or anyone see how he died?

17:00.227 --> 17:01.979
What is his name?

17:02.062 --> 17:04.189
Tell me if you know. Hurry.

17:07.985 --> 17:09.778
Do you understand, Cadet?

17:10.404 --> 17:13.282
Two days have passed
since we sealed the hole with the rock.

17:13.782 --> 17:16.785
Yet we still haven't
rounded up all the bodies.

17:17.661 --> 17:20.581
At this rate, an epidemic could break out.

17:21.290 --> 17:23.834
We must prevent a secondary disaster.

17:24.543 --> 17:27.463
There's no time
to lament our comrades' deaths.

17:27.546 --> 17:29.256
Do you understand?

17:33.552 --> 17:39.349
Member of the 104th Cadet Corps
and Captain of Squad 19,

17:39.767 --> 17:42.186
Marco Bodt.

17:42.269 --> 17:43.604
Marco.

17:43.687 --> 17:45.189
I'm glad you know his name.

17:45.856 --> 17:48.025
Let's continue.

17:58.202 --> 17:59.620
What is this?

18:03.248 --> 18:04.708
Leftover Titan vomit.

18:05.375 --> 18:07.586
Apparently they don't
have digestive systems,

18:07.669 --> 18:11.256
so they puke people out like that
once they've had their fill.

18:12.091 --> 18:13.467
You can't be serious.

18:14.259 --> 18:17.846
Damn. There's no way of telling
who is in there!

18:22.059 --> 18:23.393
I'm sorry.

18:27.189 --> 18:28.816
I'm sorry.

18:29.650 --> 18:31.193
It's no use apologizing.

18:31.985 --> 18:33.904
We need to hurry and give them a funeral.

18:59.346 --> 19:01.390
Do you have any questions?

19:03.225 --> 19:08.564
Commander Erwin, the head
of the Scout Regiment's Task Force,

19:09.815 --> 19:11.817
and Captain Levi!

19:12.943 --> 19:13.986
Where...

19:16.196 --> 19:19.366
Where am I?

19:24.329 --> 19:27.833
It should be obvious.
Let's just say it's a dungeon.

19:28.500 --> 19:31.670
You're currently in the custody
of the Military Police.

19:32.212 --> 19:36.175
For now, we are the only ones
permitted to see you.

19:39.887 --> 19:41.054
That key!

19:41.138 --> 19:43.098
Yes. It's yours.

19:43.557 --> 19:44.683
I'll return it later.

19:45.559 --> 19:49.938
Dr. Jaeger's basement,
in your home in Shiganshina...

19:50.522 --> 19:53.734
There's a secret
about the Titans hidden there, correct?

19:54.610 --> 19:56.570
Yes. I think so.

19:56.653 --> 19:58.697
That's what my father said.

19:59.364 --> 20:03.035
You've lost your memory,
and your old man is also missing.

20:03.660 --> 20:05.537
Pretty convenient story, if you ask me.

20:06.038 --> 20:07.164
Levi.

20:07.956 --> 20:11.293
We've already concluded
he has no reason to lie. You know that.

20:11.710 --> 20:14.087
There is still so little we know.

20:14.171 --> 20:17.674
But for now, I feel the most important
thing is to ask about your intentions.

20:18.926 --> 20:21.303
My intentions?

20:22.554 --> 20:24.598
If we want to check out your home,

20:24.681 --> 20:28.518
we'll need to take back
Shiganshina District along Wall Maria.

20:29.853 --> 20:34.358
Sealing the damaged gate there
would be the best way to accomplish that,

20:35.484 --> 20:37.945
which means we'll need your Titan ability.

20:39.238 --> 20:43.033
Naturally, it's a Titan
that will determine our fate.

20:43.867 --> 20:46.995
The Colossal Titan and the Armored Titan

20:47.079 --> 20:49.665
most likely work the same way as you.

20:51.583 --> 20:53.627
Your intentions are the key.

20:54.544 --> 20:58.298
The key to saving mankind
from this despair.

21:01.301 --> 21:02.344
I'm...

21:07.182 --> 21:09.476
I'm going to drive out

21:09.559 --> 21:13.397
every last one from this world!

21:14.022 --> 21:16.858
Hey. Answer the damn question, you twit.

21:17.693 --> 21:19.236
What do you want to do?

21:24.574 --> 21:26.326
I want to join the Scout Regiment

21:27.244 --> 21:29.705
and slaughter every Titan that I can!

21:32.708 --> 21:34.584
I see, not bad.

21:39.006 --> 21:42.884
Erwin, I'll take responsibility for him.

21:43.385 --> 21:45.178
Let the higher-ups know.

21:45.804 --> 21:48.181
I don't necessarily trust him though.

21:48.682 --> 21:51.310
If he betrays us or goes out of control,

21:51.393 --> 21:53.437
I'll kill him on the spot.

21:54.271 --> 21:56.356
The top brass won't complain.

21:56.440 --> 21:58.775
Because I'm the only one cut out for this.

21:59.318 --> 22:00.944
You're in.

22:01.611 --> 22:03.864
I'll make you a member
of the Scout Regiment.

23:43.755 --> 23:45.465
Promises held high.

23:45.549 --> 23:47.300
Feelings trampled upon.

23:47.384 --> 23:49.678
Anger held deep down.

23:50.637 --> 23:54.099
While in a muddled daze, Eren has visions

23:54.182 --> 23:56.351
of the things he has witnessed
since that day.
